The upstream proto/notestore.proto is reproduced as notestore.proto.txt for
reference (not generated or compiled). Sources/AppleNoteBody.swift ports the
NoteStoreProto.document (2) -> Document.note (3) -> Note.note_text (2)
field mapping to a bounded Swift wire reader. The gzip/body extraction order
is based on lib/AppleNote.rb; table/column mapping is based on lib/AppleNoteStore.rb.
SQLite snapshot, container discovery, user interface, and bounded wire-reader
implementation are project code. This is not a port of the full Ruby exporter.
No upstream personal-note fixtures, decrypted notes, or attachments are included.
The upstream schema includes its own historical attribution comments; retained.
